OL,3,AShane Richie banned from driving after
OL,4,Aspeeding
OL,5,
OL,6,FEastEnders actor Shane Richie blamed
OL,7,F"baiting" from paparazzi as he was
OL,8,Fbanned from driving for six months
OL,9,Fafter being caught speeding.
OL,11,FCourt records revealed the 62-year-old,
OL,12,Freal name Shane Roche, was hit with the
OL,13,Fdriving ban on 23 September after he
OL,14,Fadmitted the offence in Reigate,
OL,15,FSurrey.
OL,17,FHe was also fined #500 at Guildford
OL,18,FMagistrates' Court and ordered to pay
OL,19,F#320 in costs and a surcharge.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
